'''XP Bonanza!''' (超極悪ゲリラ経験値にゃ！, ''Chō Gokuaku Gerira Keikenchi Nya！'', '''Super Malevolent Guerrilla XP, Nya!''') is an [[:Category:XP Guerrilla Stages|XP guerrilla stage]] added in [[Version 11.8 Update|Version 11.8]] and unlocked after clearing [[The Gates of Aku|Unleashing the Cats]]. XP Bonanza! offers even more XP than other XP guerrilla stages, but consists of [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] rather than [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark Enemies]]. Like with [[Taste of Success (Merciless)|Merciless XP!]], only one stage can be cleared per appearance. All rewards reset for each new appearance.

